。她身穿一件深蓝色三角比基尼上衣，材质具有金属光泽，反射出柔和的光线。下身搭配一条白色短裙，裙摆轻盈，边缘有自然褶皱，裙摆部分被海水浸湿，呈现出半透明质感。她穿着黑色丝袜，丝袜紧贴腿部，表面光滑，脚部裸露，脚趾自然弯曲，脚底踩在湿润的沙滩上，脚趾间有细微的水珠。她双腿交叉，左腿在上，右腿在下，脚尖朝前，姿态放松而优雅。背景是广阔的海洋，海水呈渐变的蓝色，从近岸的浅蓝过渡到远处的深蓝，海浪轻轻拍打着沙滩，形成细腻的白色泡沫。天空晴朗，阳光明媚，光线从上方照射下来，照亮了她的身体和周围的环境，沙滩呈现出温暖的棕黄色调。整体画面色彩鲜明，光影柔和，营造出宁静而充满活力的海滨氛围。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 19, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#004d7a", "size": [290, 400], "pos": [-1078.525390625, 74.34568786621094], "id": 19, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "f2838ed5e59de4d73cde5c98354b87a8d3200190", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [19], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#0074b7", "widgets_values": ["你是一位专业的AI图像生成提示词工程师。请详细描述这张图像，并生成中文提示词。\n\n要求：不要出现对图像水印的描述，不要出现无关的文字和符号，注意正确描述人物，不需要总结，限制在600字以内", "Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct-FP8", "none", false, 0.7, 2048, 200704, 1003520, 100, "fixed", "eager"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "source_path", "label": "source_path", "type": "PATH", "localized_name": "source_path"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 30, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature"